    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/c06b8b5e04e157649fdc56f17d87e9bc.avif?t=1755614776\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a mysterious world where mythology and mythic wrestling collide. In this mystical roguelike, you play as Maj, a wandering soul driven by redemption and purpose. Master grapples, throws, and counters in battles where every encounter with twisted spirits and mythic heroes feels like an ancient duel of strength, wit, and resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/5735c9f609a23714e97c08f035ba43f7.webp?t=1755614776\" width=641 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in close-quarters, wrestling-inspired melee combat with tactical options and counters that demand timing and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/e9f23cc9221e2ae379af161c63d8f97e.poster.avif?t=1755614776\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/e9f23cc9221e2ae379af161c63d8f97e.webm?t=1755614776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/e9f23cc9221e2ae379af161c63d8f97e.mp4?t=1755614776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/4d88d9933