paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/fd53fc927c64dd92c6677e4a8c998fca.webp?t=1755614776\" width=641 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever-shifting labyrinth of storms and enchanted valleys. Each descent into the cursed Byzantine citadel presents winding paths, dangerous encounters, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/bb8c142b29d710b285aa93ff2187a42b.poster.avif?t=1755614776\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/bb8c142b29d710b285aa93ff2187a42b.webm?t=1755614776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/bb8c142b29d710b285aa93ff2187a42b.mp4?t=1755614776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/2e05bfb04dcffa09381a07e90456bcb9.webp?t=1755614776\" width=641 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/1d5c5ad6256572388c984d4d4aa50365.webp?t=1755614776\" width=641 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle  iconic bosses and mythic characters like Hercules, who wield both physical prowess and powerful abilities that will challenge your skills and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin